    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Assistant Professor and researcher, Dr Abdul Momin Kazi at the Aga Khan University (AKU) has successfully secured a National Institute of Health (NIH) R01 grant. The highly prestigious grant provides support for health-related research and development based on the mission of the NIH, which is the largest public funder of biomedical research in the world.",
